OL,3,AUS House blocks bid to impeach Defence
OL,4,ASecretary Pete Hegseth, for now
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier in the day, in his first news
OL,7,Fbriefing from the Pentagon in six
OL,8,Fmonths, Hegseth called the impeachment
OL,9,Feffort a "farce" and "sabotage".
OL,11,FIt was seen as a long shot as it would
OL,12,Fhave required a number of other
OL,13,FRepublicans to defy President Donald
OL,14,FTrump.
